{"The permission check for team admins or owners is incorrect - using && requires a user to be both an admin/owner and an owner, which effectively only allows owners and prevents team admins from adding guests": 0.9281715154647827, "The code assumes booking.userId will always have a value, but the database schema allows it to be null - if null, the fallback to 0 will cause prisma.user.findFirstOrThrow to crash the request": 0.8712882399559021, "The Zod schema ZAddGuestsInputSchema is being redefined on every render of the AddGuestsDialog component instead of being defined once at the top-level scope": 0.2689298093318939, "Silently catching errors with console.log hides important issues in production - should use console.error or the project's structured logger for email sending failures": 0.8253035545349121}